OL,3,GNEWSATrams without conductors called
OL,4,A'backward step'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPassengers say the Midland Metro's new
OL,7,FBuy Before You Board system is already
OL,8,Fcausing confusion and could make fare
OL,9,Fdodging worse.
OL,11,FThe scheme means passengers must buy a
OL,12,Fticket before boarding a tram - but
OL,13,Fsome have already called the removal of
OL,14,Fconductors a "backward step".
OL,16,FConductors are being replaced by
OL,17,Frevenue protection officers, who will
OL,18,Fcarry out spot checks, supported by
OL,19,Fpolice and security teams.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
